{
  "language": "en",
  "method": "Synthesis word boundaries, corrected for exact PCM lead trim; text from narration.json.",
  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.203,
      "end": 2.316,
      "text": "Our data comes from interactive portals",
      "segment": 1,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 2.316,
      "end": 5.499,
      "text": "like ASAP and GSCM,",
      "segment": 1,
      "firstWord": 6,
      "lastWord": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 5.499,
      "end": 7.516,
      "text": "where we download ready-made reports.",
      "segment": 1,
      "firstWord": 16,
      "lastWord": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 9.155,
      "end": 10.933,
      "text": "But downloads alone aren't ready",
      "segment": 2,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 10.933,
      "end": 13.497,
      "text": "for analysis or scheduled reporting.",
      "segment": 2,
      "firstWord": 5,
      "lastWord": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 13.497,
      "end": 15.469,
      "text": "We still need to extract the data,",
      "segment": 2,
      "firstWord": 10,
      "lastWord": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 15.469,
      "end": 17.119,
      "text": "standardize its format,",
      "segment": 2,
      "firstWord": 17,
      "lastWord": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 17.119,
      "end": 18.82,
      "text": "and load it into a destination.",
      "segment": 2,
      "firstWord": 20,
      "lastWord": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 20.15,
      "end": 21.295,
      "text": "Meet Metronome.",
      "segment": 3,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 21.295,
      "end": 24.414,
      "text": "Build data pipelines in minutes, without code.",
      "segment": 3,
      "firstWord": 2,
      "lastWord": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 24.414,
      "end": 25.367,
      "text": "Schedule them,",
      "segment": 3,
      "firstWord": 9,
      "lastWord": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 25.367,
      "end": 27.094,
      "text": "trigger a run when you need it,",
      "segment": 3,
      "firstWord": 11,
      "lastWord": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 27.094,
      "end": 29.159,
      "text": "and track every run in one place.",
      "segment": 3,
      "firstWord": 18,
      "lastWord": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 31.202,
      "end": 32.8,
      "text": "Instead of writing a script,",
      "segment": 4,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 32.8,
      "end": 34.153,
      "text": "build your own Flow.",
      "segment": 4,
      "firstWord": 5,
      "lastWord": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 34.153,
      "end": 36.222,
      "text": "Choose a website and the report you need.",
      "segment": 4,
      "firstWord": 9,
      "lastWord": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 38.4,
      "end": 40.824,
      "text": "Choose where the data goes and when it runs.",
      "segment": 5,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 45.008,
      "end": 46.993,
      "text": "While the script is still being written,",
      "segment": 6,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 46.993,
      "end": 49.311,
      "text": "your Flow is ready. No code needed.",
      "segment": 6,
      "firstWord": 7,
      "lastWord": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 52.202,
      "end": 55.14,
      "text": "At two AM, local AI agents keep working",
      "segment": 7,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 55.14,
      "end": 57.305,
      "text": "across your reports and pipelines,",
      "segment": 7,
      "firstWord": 8,
      "lastWord": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 57.305,
      "end": 58.761,
      "text": "checking missing data,",
      "segment": 7,
      "firstWord": 13,
      "lastWord": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 58.761,
      "end": 60.888,
      "text": "refresh issues, and blank rows.",
      "segment": 7,
      "firstWord": 16,
      "lastWord": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 64.203,
      "end": 66.639,
      "text": "By morning, five issues are flagged.",
      "segment": 8,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 66.639,
      "end": 69.685,
      "text": "Open one to see the evidence and a proposed fix.",
      "segment": 8,
      "firstWord": 6,
      "lastWord": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 72.208,
      "end": 74.334,
      "text": "There are two ways to use Metronome.",
      "segment": 9,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 74.334,
      "end": 77.315,
      "text": "Open it in your browser, just like any other website.",
      "segment": 9,
      "firstWord": 7,
      "lastWord": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 79,
      "end": 82.129,
      "text": "Or connect Metronome MCP to your AI,",
      "segment": 10,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 82.129,
      "end": 83.867,
      "text": "and create flows with a prompt.",
      "segment": 10,
      "firstWord": 9,
      "lastWord": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 85.202,
      "end": 86.607,
      "text": "Without that connection,",
      "segment": 11,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 86.607,
      "end": 90.125,
      "text": "your AI may take wrong turns, retry steps,",
      "segment": 11,
      "firstWord": 3,
      "lastWord": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 90.125,
      "end": 92.057,
      "text": "or return the wrong reporting period.",
      "segment": 11,
      "firstWord": 11,
      "lastWord": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 93.703,
      "end": 95.662,
      "text": "With Metronome MCP,",
      "segment": 12,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 95.662,
      "end": 97.376,
      "text": "it can follow the portal workflow,",
      "segment": 12,
      "firstWord": 5,
      "lastWord": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 97.376,
      "end": 99.572,
      "text": "create your Flow, and check the result.",
      "segment": 12,
      "firstWord": 11,
      "lastWord": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 102.511,
      "end": 103.761,
      "text": "Fewer retries.",
      "segment": 13,
      "firstWord": 0,
      "lastWord": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 103.761,
      "end": 105.862,
      "text": "Less time and fewer tokens.",
      "segment": 13,
      "firstWord": 2,
      "lastWord": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 105.862,
      "end": 108.622,
      "text": "Accurate data, in your own repeatable Flow.",
      "segment": 13,
      "firstWord": 7,
      "lastWord": 13
    }
  ],
